{"id":"cordero","lemma":"cordero","pos":"noun","rank":3075,"glosses":["lamb"],"ipa":"/koɾˈdeɾo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"corderos","feminine":"cordera","femininePlural":"corderas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-cordero.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ahí está la madre del cordero.","en":"That's the snag.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/733127","words":[{"g":"there"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"mother"},{"g":"of the"},null]},{"text":"Los corderos son bebés oveja.","en":"Lambs are baby sheep.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800912","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"baby","l":"bebé"},{"g":"sheep"}]},{"text":"Él es un lobo con piel de cordero.","en":"He is a wolf in sheep's clothing.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"wolf"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"skin"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Los corderos son crías de oveja.","en":"Lambs are baby sheep.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"kid, pup, cria","l":"cría"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"sheep"}]},{"text":"Algunos políticos son lobos con piel de cordero.","en":"Some politicians are wolves in sheep's clothing.","words":[{"g":"someone","l":"alguno"},{"g":"political","l":"político"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"wolf","l":"lobo"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"skin"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}